["ol", "Lines in each direction: 9|Intervals in each direction: 9 - 1 = 8|Cells: 8 x 8 = 64|Required cells: 81|Difference: 81 - 64 = 17 cells too few|Correction: add one more line in each direction and re-space all ten lines equally, so that nine intervals result"],
["box", "Why not just add one line? Adding a line without re-spacing makes unequal intervals, which fails the verification checklist. The whole grid must be redrawn with equal spacing."]
